  "description": "INACTIVE WINDOWS POWERSHELL HOST EXAMPLE ONLY. Uses the Host-provided PowerShell; no nested shell. Requires separately pinned runtime, approved registry, protected data root, and per-event budgets: 5s for UserPromptSubmit and Stop, 2s for SessionStart, and 3s for SessionEnd, SubagentStart, and SubagentStop. These are configuration requirements, not a claim of host verification. Do not install into a cmd/bash Host."
